      "message": "Yeah, the existing code wasn\u0027t great about being FS agnostic, but I can do better. I half botched doing this using the seperator constant in places, but that really isn\u0027t the correct way to do this.\n\nThe idiomatic fix is to use To/FromSlash when going in/out of the fstest filesystem, since it expects/behaves vaguely like a unix style FS. Then rework the test paths to have a runtime determined root (/ or C:\\ as appropriate) and then use Join to correctly build paths. I tested this in my WIP prototype code, and it doesn\u0027t look too invasive to add into this stack of CLs.",
